                "text": "For 60 years, Medicaid and Medicare have been vital lifelines helping Americans access high-quality, affordable health care.\n\nBut Trump\u2019s Big Ugly Law is the largest Medicaid cut in history\u2014kicking over 15 million off their health insurance and forcing hospitals and nursing homes to close.\n\nWe must overturn the Big Ugly Bill.",
